    "detailed_description": "<h1>Join our official discord server!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome anglers,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our Discord and get in on the action early!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk to us, catch sneak peeks, and communicate with anglers all over the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t forget to wishlist Fishing Hero on Steam!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more wishlists we get, the sooner you can start fishing.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hook, Fight, and Reel!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A hidden giant lurks below, waiting for its next challenger. The moment you hook it, the battle begins! Feel the tension as the line tightens, the struggle as you reel it in, and the rush of victory when you land the legendary catch. Are you ready for the fight of your life?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128000/extras/f1d73ed446b23ead5ad3dc75d328c151.poster.avif?t=1750126989\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128000/extras/f1d73ed446b23ead5ad3dc75d328c151.webm?t=1750126989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128000/extras/f1d73ed446b23ead5ad3dc75d328c151.mp4?t=1750126989\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>100+ epic fish &amp; Legendary gear</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Common fish? Been there, done that! Now it's time for the real deal to catch massive groupers, albino beasts, and deep-sea giants. Upgrade your own rod, power up the reel, and get ready to land the biggest catch of your life!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128000/extras/2e51c34fc05360930edf53ebcdbd00c1.poster.avif?t=1750126989\" width=800 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128000/extras/2e51c34fc05360930edf53ebcdbd00c1.webm?t=1750126989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128000/extras/2e51c34fc05360930edf53ebcdbd00c1.mp4?t=1750126989\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>All aboard for an epic fishing journey</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hop aboard your dream boat and explore the world\u2019s greatest fishing spots! From the crystal-clear waters of Southeast Asia to the mysterious Indian Ocean, the vast Atlantic, and the rich fishing grounds of North and South America\u2014an unforgettable journey awaits. Conquer the waves and reel in legendary catches from around the world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128000/extras/f82708cae2f210c8e317e646444ac2fd.poster.avif?t=1750126989\" width=616 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128000/extras/f82708cae2f210c8e317e646444ac2fd.webm?t=1750126989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128000/extras/f82708cae2f210c8e317e646444ac2fd.mp4?t=1750126989\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Endless excitement, your own fishing legacy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae Freestyle Mode \u2013 Cast your line and relax in solo fishing</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc6 Solo Match \u2013 Compete against anglers from around the world</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd1d Team Match \u2013 Team up and experience the thrill of co-op fishing</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete, cooperate, and create unforgettable moments in various game modes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover rare species, expand your fish collection, and design an awesome aquarium filled with stunning creatures!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128000/extras/a39d8992aabdc873c4eb5612462a843f.poster.avif?t=1750126989\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128000/extras/a39d8992aabdc873c4eb5612462a843f.webm?t=1750126989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128000/extras/a39d8992aabdc873c4eb5612462a843f.mp4?t=1750126989\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Express yourself with unique customization</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fishing is more than just skill\u2014it\u2019s style! Mix and match different outfits and gear to create a look that\u2019s all your own. Sporty, flashy, or totally wild\u2014the ocean is your runway!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128000/extras/e4d0d98a1c0db105efcb67f27d0648d0.poster.avif?t=1750126989\" width=616 height=347 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128000/extras/e4d0d98a1c0db105efcb67f27d0648d0.webm?t=1750126989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
